window.products.push({"id":388038,"name":"Sufdari Cotton Duvet Cover Set King Size, 100% Cotton Waffle Weave Olive Green Duvet Cover 3 Pieces, Bedding Duvet Cover with Zipper Ties, Soft Cotton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKPry0xBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【CLASSIC WAFFLE WEAVE DESIGN】 This Nordic style bedding duvet cover set merges rustic bedding and modern bedding styles for a timeless look that instantly transforms your bedroom to incorporate your unique sense of style 【ULTRA SOFT 100% COTTON & BETTER SLEEP】The waffle weave duvet cover set is made of 100% cotton fabric offers ultra softness and breathability for you. Compared with microfiber/polyester materials, the cotton duvet cover adopt high density textile effectively prevent the lightweight duvet cover from tearing. The under side of the nordic style bedding is cozy and the textured side is almost silky-soft to the touch 【HIDDEN ZIPPER & CORNER TIES】Our bedding duvet covers use delicately hidden zipper which is easy for you to insert or remove your duvet. The inner straps at the 4 corners of the olive green duvet cover are firmly distributed to help fix your duvet, to ensure that the quilt core will not move and stay flat. So you don't have to worry about the comforter bunching up when you sleep 【EASY CARE & DURABLE】The Sufdari duvet cover can be machine washed with similar colors. Make sure to close the zipper completely when washing and use a laundry bag to avoid damage to the tufts. Dry it in low-temperature rollers or in the shade, please do not iron! Our farmhouse duvet cover set adopts advanced reactive printing and dyeing technology, which ensures that the colors will not fade easily. We recommend washing them before use to make you sleep more comfortable 【WHAT YOU CAN GET】3 pieces duvet cover set includes 1 king size duvet cover (104\"x90\") and 2 pillowcases (20\"x36\"). (COMFORTER/DUVET INSERT NOT INCLUDED.) We offer 2 colors and 3 sizes to choose from! If you have any issue about the Sufdari duvet cover set, please contact us immediately. We offer a 30-day refund and replacement service, and will solve your problem within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKPry0xBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sufdari","source_asin":"B0BJ2DBLCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ2DBLCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ2DBLCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
