window.products.push({"id":388072,"name":"Home-X 4-Section Mesh Laundry Bag, Small Divided Meshed Bag for Washing Delicates","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CJGScyH+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Washing some pieces of clothing can be a hassle! Hosiery gets tangled up in other clothes, the clips on bra straps snag sweaters, and blouses might come out with tears because of the fine fabric. But washing clothes doesn’t have to be so difficult! We have designed an easy solution so that you can wash all of your clothing together without worry. This mesh bag features 4 compartments, allowing you to sort and wash a variety of garments at once. Put your socks in one compartment and athletic clothing in another. This feature keeps clothing protected so you can avoid tears, snags, rips, and other damage. Mesh allows water to pass through the bag and reach your clothing, so they get clean in your washing machine. Likewise, air can pass through the closely spaced holes to dry your clothes. Throw the laundry holder into your washing machine or dryer along with the rest of your load. The durable fabric will last for many washes to come, making washing, drying, and folding your clothes a lot easier. But that’s not all this bag can do! You can use it for home organization as well. Store baby or kids clothing, transport your workout clothing in your gym bag, or organize small craft supplies or other accessories. Use the sectional bag for neatly packing your suitcase on your next vacation! The different pockets let you separate clean and dirty laundry as you travel. Plus, the bag is small enough to store in your closet or dresser drawer. Get your laundry mesh bag today and treat your delicates the way they deserve to be treated!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CJGScyH+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07PMKR4TS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PMKR4TS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PMKR4TS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
