window.products.push({"id":388110,"name":"HooTown Wire Shelf Liners 5 Sheets Fit Wire Shelving Size 30 Inch x 14 Inch, Clear Frosted Hard Plastic Protector Mats for Metal Stainless Steel Garag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616aFseLSqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HooTown wire shelf liners 5 Sheets - fit wire shelving size 30\" x 14\" of Amazon Basics, Seville Classics. We have two design styles for you to choice, one has corner cut (the options with ”-Notched” at the end), the other has not. You can choose the right product according to your personal preferences. Our wire shelf liners with both designs are easy to trim with any household scissors. ✅MAKE YOUR WIRE SHELF PERFECT: As an upgrade to the wire shelf liner mats for garage, cabinets, kitchen, pantry closet, shoe shelves can provide a flat surface to prevent small items from falling through or getting stuck between the wires. With this liner you don’t need to bother balancing objects on the wires to prevent them from falling over any more. So convenient and useful! ✅PREMIUM QUALITY AND SAFETY: Made of high quality material, the clear frosted hard plastic shelving mats for metal stainless steel rack is thick and strong enough for any heavy duty situation. You can put anything you want on this liner - as long as your shelf can hold it. As tested in our lab, this liner also has good penetration resistance by daily use. The PP plastic we use is without odor or BPA. So you do not have to concern about healthy when using this liner, even if you want to put your food directly on it! ✅WATERPROOF AND CHANGEBLE: Benefit from the premium material, this shelf liner is totally waterproof. Water or oil won’t leave any stain on its surface. So if your liner gets dirty you can freely wipe it with a wet rag or directly wash it under a faucet. In addition it also works well with common detergents. If you don’t like your liner any more you can remove it and change a new one as this liner is non-adhesive. ✅VERSATILE USAGE: Our wire shelf liners are designed with common sizes to fit standard wire racks. But they can not only be used in wire metal rack shelves, but also in all kinds of cabinet and shelves to prevent small items from falling over or to make your items look clean and tidy. With Hootown liners all of your shelves and cabinets are much easier to clean. So basically this liner can be used in any situation like in kitchen shelves, in garage, or in pantry etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616aFseLSqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HooTown","source_asin":"B08P34GCT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P34GCT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P34GCT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
