window.products.push({"id":388241,"name":"Granbest 3 Piece High Stretch Couch Covers Loveseat Slipcover Super Soft Sofa Cover Form Fit Non-Slip Furniture Protector with Individual Cushion Cove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d0urzXN2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUSTOMIZED DESIGN: This updated 4 piece sofa cover for 3 cushion couch includes 1 base sofa cover and 3 cushion covers, especially designed for those sofas with removable seat cushions or back cushions. Featuring individual seat cushion covers, this stretch sofa cover will fit better and will perfectly follow contours of most couches. The elastic bottom band is designed to keep your sofa slipcover in place without the constant slipping and tucking. PREMIUM FABRIC&AESTHETIC DECOR: Adopted by advanced active printing and dyeing new technology, our magic sofa covers with unique polyester-spandex blend fabric is skin friendly, soft to touch, no fading, no pilling, wrinkle-free, thick and study, durable for long term usage. With a brief style and appealing colors, our fitted couch cover will update your entire home decoration style and enhance the luxury feeling of the living room. MEASURE SIZE: Please measure your sofa before choosing our sofa slipcovers, our large size is suitable for sofa length between 71\"-92\", medium size is suitable for sofa length 56\"-70\". Each seat cushion cover measures up to 20-25 inches length, 20-27.5 inches wide, 2-9 inches thickness. For detailed measuring guide, please check our attached picture. FULL PROTECTION: Our 3-seats sofa slipcover can cover all sides of your sofa, providing all-round protection. Not only will this furniture protector deter scratching, muddy paws, dirt, and daily tears, it is also resistant to stains and dust proof to withstand the rigors of day-to-day use. This attractively designed 4 piece couch slipcover can give your living room a fresh new look while extending the lifetime of your furniture. They're a must-have for homes with pets! EASY CARE AND INSTALLATION: 1. Remove seat cushions from furniture. 2.Find two \"BACK\" labels in the seam of sofa slipcover and locate the them at the left and right corners of furniture's back. 3. Cover the furniture from back to front by following the seams and tuck in extra fabric. 4.Cover seat cushions and put them back to furniture. Machine washable in cold water for easy care and maintenance. Gentle cycle and tumble dry low. Do Not Bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d0urzXN2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granbest","source_asin":"B087JGCRXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087JGCRXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087JGCRXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
