window.products.push({"id":388340,"name":"Zak Designs White 21-bye-13-1/2-Inch Full Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B48vVc2iS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Gallery trays are 100% melamine and are stackable for easy storage Amazon.com Lightweight yet sturdy, Zak Designs Gallery trays make it easy to have breakfast in bed or lemonade and cookies under a shade tree. This large version in pure white features an ample, rectangular serving area framed by tall sides and curved corners to securely hold plates, bowls, and glassware. The melamine construction is rigid and durable so it stands up to frequent use, and the smooth finish resists stains, marks, and odors. Two oblong handles cut out of the tray's ends assist with carrying. Add the matching white medium tray for smaller jobs or mix and match other Gallery tray colors to create a fun, vibrant set--choose from pool blue, turquoise, or black. The trays sit neatly inside each other and go safely into the dishwasher for convenient cleanup. They are not suitable for microwave use. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B48vVc2iS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B000EOQVHI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EOQVHI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EOQVHI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
