window.products.push({"id":388343,"name":"12 Sheets Full Wraps Nail Art Polish Stickers Valentine's Day Series Full Cover Sticker Nail Strips for Women Adhesive Nail Decals Design Manicure Tip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JAb-VNEfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"How to use nail polish stickers? 1. Push back cuticle & file the nail surface (this is to smoothen the nail surface & to remove grease & moisture to achieve a long-lasting result). Remember to clean the nail afterward. 2. Select the suitable sizes (cut to the correct size if necessary). 3. Carefully remove the transparent protective layer. Then peel it off carefully. 4. Position onto the moon of the nail. Make sure the sticker curve touches the cuticle line. Press gently through the central line of the nail plate towards the free edge. Forget about the excess at this point. 5. Press from the moon towards the nail groove size by size. During this step, squeeze the air out of the sticker to ensure a smooth touch. 6. Cut the excess sticker, and then file the edges gently to make it smooth. 7. To ensure a long-lasting result, apply a UV topcoat. Tips: Avoid touching water within two hours, especially hot water. It is recommended to use it at night. Don’t apply on cuticles and skins. Leave a bit of space between nails and cuticles. If So, the stickers can keep for longer. Use with base coat and topcoat. Package includes: 10 Sheet nail polish sticker","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JAb-VNEfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impres","source_asin":"B08R2FSF5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R2FSF5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R2FSF5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
