window.products.push({"id":388358,"name":"Natural Dried Pampas Grass Decor Bouquet, 85PCS Boho Home Decor Pampas-Grass Bouquet, Dried Pompus Pompus Grass, Bouquet for Wedding Floral Arrangemen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HFz-i8ufL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌹Natural & Beauty: Dried Natural Pampas Grass, also known as bunny or hare’s tail grass, adds a natural, bohemian element to your home decor. You can showcase them in a beautiful vase or hang them on a garland; the decorative possibilities are almost endless for home wedding party. All beauty loving women/ girl need her-NEVER FORGET TO SAY \"THANKS\" FOR HER (VASES NOT INCLUDED) ✅High-Quality Materials: Natural dried pampas grass is made from 100% natural high-quality reed grass, giving you the original touch, non-toxic and harmless. And unlike fresh flower arrangements, they require no maintenance once the plumes are conditioned, so these soft and fluffy boho Pompass grass will sit effortlessly in any setting, making you feel like you are on the pampas and adding a natural fun of texture 🌹Interesting DIY & Multipurpose Pampas Decoration: Please keep up with new year's fashion trends. Pampas grass has a comfortable feel, soft and fluffy that is the best choice for flower arrangement. Natural dried pampas grass are perfect for indoor & outdoor decor, it can be set the mood as vase fillers, DIY Christmas and door wreath, placed around table, living room, country decor etc. Dried pampas grass is perfect for wedding centerpieces or dress up a glorious wedding head table backdrop ✅Multifunctional Use-Natural Pampas Grass: Dried pampas grass bouquet is very suitable for interior decoration, offices, hotels, cafés, restaurants, farmhouse, and also very suitable for wedding decorations. On Birthdays, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas and other special holidays, you can also give pampas grass to family and friends. This will be a surprise gift while they receive it ✅85-in-1 Package Pampas Grass Bouquet: carefully selected natural dried pampas grass decor, try to avoid deformation and breakage of dried pampas grass, 85 pieces of pampass grass contain 15pcs white pampas, 15pcs natural pampas, 30pcs reed grass & 25pcs bunny tail grass(pampas grass vase not included) fill your vase, you can match it with different dried pompas floral bouquets according to your preference ✅Easy to Use: The pampas grass are packed tightly in a plastic bag and it carries a slight odor of nature. It is recommended to store it in a dry, ventilated and sunny place for several days. Pampas grass will become fluffy and the smell will no longer exist. These are naturally dried grass that may shed when taken out of the package. Shedding will be minimal once you place in vase. We can also use hairdryer to help pampas grass fluff up the plumes and hair spray to reduce the shedding ✅Natural Boho Pampas Grass Decor: Pampas grass bedroom decor can help you relax after a hard day at work and help lift your mood when you wake up early in the morning. A decor that unfolds in the bedroom is a good idea because it will have a greater impact on the ambiance and overall look of the room (VASES NOT INCLUDED)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HFz-i8ufL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prt.ASSTNT","source_asin":"B0B1H82RD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1H82RD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1H82RD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
