window.products.push({"id":388363,"name":"Sealtek 120 Mylar Bags for Food Storage With 220 Oxygen Absorbers 400cc - 8 Mil Thick 10\"x15\", 6\"x9\", 4\"x7\", 3\"x5\" - Resealable Mylar Bags Stand Up - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eFuAztj0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"120 VALUE PACK: 120 mylar bags for food storage with oxygen absorbers in 4 different sizes. 25 pcs of X-large 1 gallon mylar bags that are 4 mil thick 10”x15”, 35 pcs of large 4 mil thick 6”x9”, 30 pcs of medium 3 mil thick 4”x7” and 30 pcs of small 3 mil thick 3”x5”. The set also comes with label stickers. BONUS 100 & Newly Upgraded Oxygen Absorbers: This bundle gives you a total of 220 oxygen absorbers. With the bonus 100 oxygen absorbers, you save more and gain more. We have also upgraded our oxygen absorbers from 300cc to 400cc for higher efficiency. Get oxygen absorbers that finally work! Thick Layered Mylar Bags : Our Sealtek stand-up mylar ziplock bags are made of quality PET Aluminum foil that have a maximum thickness of 8 mil with 4 mil on each layer. These resealable mylar bags are smell proof, food safe and BPA free. Perfect for your food storage needs. Pinhole & Puncture Resistant: Our sealable bags are thick, pinhole and puncture resistant. These mylar bags can be used to store frozen foods, cookies, candies, beans, spices, and even smaller items such as jewellery, accessories and make-up essentials. Our mylar vacuum seal bags are built strong to last long. Use & Re-use: Our mylar food storage bags are reusable and resealable. Easy to use as they are heat sealable with a flat iron, hair straightener or a vacuum sealer. These mylar bags with oxygen absorbers will keep your food products inside fresh at all times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eFuAztj0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sealtek","source_asin":"B098TR4FHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098TR4FHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098TR4FHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":388364,"name":"Flora Element Portable Air Conditioners, 120° Oscillation Mini Evaporative Air Cooler, 4 in 1 Upgraded Personal Desk Fan, 3 Wind Speeds 7 Colors Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fWDr7e6lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【5 in 1 Air Cooler】 Try this functional and small portable air conditioner when you crave a cool summer breeze but don't want the hassle of running an air conditioner. With this mini air conditioner, you get the equivalent of buying 5 things for the price of one: a fan, a humidifier, an aromatherapy machine, a night light and an air conditioner. 【120°Auto Swing & 90°Vent Adjustment】 This evaporative air cooler features with an auto 120° oscillation, allowing the cold air to spread more widely than other brands. With loose leaf shutters, you can easily adjust the pivots of 90° up and down by turning them manually, allowing you to feel cool wind in many ways. 【Touch Screen & Timing Function】 The room air conditioner features with touch screen function. Plug it into USB port or power bank and press the switch button and hold for a few seconds. Then the mini air cooler is turned on. the air conditioner fan can generate all night. You can also settle the air cooler for 1-12 hours by pressing the button. Keeping your body cool at night for a good sleep. 【700ML Large Capacity Water Tank】 The evaporative air cooler has a large 700ml capacity water tank, max duration up to 14 hours on low mist mode. There is a low water protection function when the water capacity is low and will change to natural wind. Also the visual water level allows you observe the water level clearly. 【7 Colors Night Light】This portable air cooler can also be used as a night light while you sleep. Not only does it have an adjustable 7-colour night light, it also has a night light cycle mode. The light is soft and will not hurt your eyes at night. It's a perfect device to place on your bedside table by the bed and in your baby's room, giving you peace of mind and making it easy to care for your baby.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fWDr7e6lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flora Element","source_asin":"B0C6D431T5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6D431T5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6D431T5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
