window.products.push({"id":388623,"name":"Burr Beans Grinder for Coffee: Manual Fresh Coffee Maker, Stainless Steel Portable & Sleek Design, Ceramic Conical Burr Mill for Consistency, Precisio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SvVYeNz-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing The New, High Quality Coffee Grinder By Master Class Products: For Perfectly Ground Coffee Anytime, Anywhere!   If you are looking for the best Ceramic Coffee grinder money can buy, then you have come to the right place.   Master Class Products have created the finest, most convenient and durable Ceramic Coffee Grinder. The ideal tool for mouth-watering, perfectly ground coffee that will amaze your tastebuds! A cutting edge tool designed specifically for coffee lovers who are serious about their daily cup. A must have utensil that effectively delivers a flavorful, aroma-rich version of your favorite brown goodness! This Coffee Grinder Has BEEN LOVED By Coffee Fans All Over The World: The Master Class Products Coffee Grinder boasts the highest durability and quality on the market. All our products are made upon our Gold Quality Standards to ensure their superior quality and performance!   That ís why they are also backed up by an 100% Money Back Guarantee. We are so confident that you will also be delighted with our Coffee Grinder, that we also give you the chance to get every penny back if you are not satisfied!  Operating Instruction of Grinder :- Step 1: Pour coffee beans from top receptacle, the grinder adjusts quickly .(No need to unscrew the entire grinder in order to adjust the grind size. Simply turn the knob clockwise or counter-clockwise in order to reach perfect size for any coffee drink) Step 2 : Turn the handle, grind beans by attaching the handle to the top of the grinder. The grinder is easy gripping and the crank handle is long enough to give you good leverage for a smooth and easy grind. Step 3: Take off the ground container, pour out the coffee powder, perfect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SvVYeNz-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Master Class Product","source_asin":"B017FMAEOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017FMAEOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017FMAEOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
