window.products.push({"id":388645,"name":"Konpex Heavy Duty Garlic Press – Quickly & Easily Chop, Mince, Crush & Press Whole Garlic Cloves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QC3rXRabL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Love the taste of garlic but loathe the idea of chopping up whole cloves? Why should you choose this handheld garlic press by Konpex?  Here are just a few of the many reasons why our garlic crusher is the #1 choice: - Quickly Minces, Chops & Crushes  - Accommodates WHOLE Garlic Cloves  - Made Out Of Strong Zinc Alloy Metal - Heavy Duty Design  - Extremely Easy to Use - Ergonomic Handles  - Anti-Slip Stripping Due to the heavy duty construction and unmatched durability of our garlic crusher, it has become one of our bestselling kitchen accessories. No longer do you have to worry about an accident occurring while you prepare minced garlic for savory dishes such as soups, garnishes and veggie sides using the traditional kitchen knife and cutting board. We just know you will enjoy having this garlic press around the kitchen because it provides a QUICK, EASY & SAFE way to chop, mince, crush or press whole garlic cloves along with other spices. The end result is perfectly minced garlic you can incorporate into your recipe. This means you can flavor all of your dishes as much as you please while also saving valuable time on meal prep. What more could you possibly ask for? For added safety and gripping power, this handheld garlic press is equipped with a pair of ergonomic handles . They arecovered in a slip-proof silicone material that ensures the garlic press doesn't slip out of your hand when in use. Thanks to the unique shape and design, our garlic press is also incredibly easy to keep clean . Simply toss it in the dishwasher, wipe it down or rinse it off between uses.  It's finally time to add this metal garlic presser to your collection of kitchen accessories. Click 'Add to Cart' to order your own heavy duty garlic press by Konpex today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QC3rXRabL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Konpex","source_asin":"B01DHHKZT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DHHKZT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DHHKZT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
