window.products.push({"id":388675,"name":"bC BimeTALliC CAble Shampoo Brush Scalp Massage Hair Soft Silicone Comb for Men, Women and Pets, Set of 2, Green & Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H6BWolWSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to use the Hair Scalp Massage?1. Put appropriate shampoo on the wet hair. Circle around in the hair until making a lot of froth, then move brush slowly on the hair for 5-6 minutes.2. Slowly move the brush over your entire scalp from the front of your head, using much or little pressure as you like.3.Must be taking care to spend extra time on areas where might flaking or dry scalp.Why choose bC BimeTALliC CAble’s scalp massage brush? 1.Fits for all hair types with soft thick silicone bristles on dry or wet, will not hurt hair and scalp, also suit for kids or old people. 2.Promote scalp blood circulation, strengthen the roots of hair, prevent hair loss, dandruff and other issues. 3.Easy to use, deep cleaning of the scalp hair follicles with less shampoo and conditioner, making hair more clean and healthy.4.Relax the scalp muscles, help to relieve headache and daily working stress.6.Used as daily meridian massage comb whenever you want to relax.Package contents-2* scalp massage brushes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H6BWolWSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bC BimeTALliC CAble","source_asin":"B07G5Q719W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G5Q719W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G5Q719W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
