window.products.push({"id":388770,"name":"West & Fifth Semitransparent Honeycomb-Textured Tumbler, Insulated Tumbler With Straw, 24 Ounces, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X0B3QPBPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Need a way to keep your water or iced coffee cool throughout the day? West & Fifth introduces our handy reusable tumbler, the perfect cup for cold liquids that stands out from other tumblers. The outside is decorated with matte-coated rubber and features a unique semitransparent and spiky honeycomb texture that can massage your hands as you hold it. This textured tumbler holds 3 cups of your favorite beverage and maintains the temperature inside for hours to keep your drink refreshing. The lid has a special rubber ring that keeps it twisted on tight while preventing any spill or leak accidents, and each straw has a stopper ring on the base that keeps it from falling out and adds extra leak protection. Made with sturdy polystyrene and safe food-grade materials, this tumbler can withstand daily use as you go about your routine. It is lightweight enough to carry to the office, to your car, to the gym, or around your home, and it holds 24 oz. of liquid. Wrap up this tumbler to give to your loved ones as a fun way for them to stay hydrated while expressing their style. Find the cup you’ll love with our reusable tumbler options!All of our tumblers are 100% free from BPA, BPS, phthalates, and mercury for your safety and convenience. To wash your water and iced-coffee tumbler, remove the lid and the straw to clean the inside of the cup. Wash the cup by hand in a sink, and let it dry before the next use. This tumbler should not be used with hot liquids. Do not put this item in the dishwasher or in the microwave.At West & Fifth, we believe that there’s no such thing as a one-size-fits-all product. All of our products are exclusive, as they are designed in-house using fun, vibrant, fashion-forward, and custom colors and designs. Since inception, we’ve designed and launched over a thousand other quality products. We’re constantly bringing new products to market to fit with current seasons, colors, and trends that we’re sure you’ll love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X0B3QPBPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West & Fifth","source_asin":"B0BTK335T5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTK335T5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTK335T5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":388771,"name":"Khordin Expandable Spice Drawer Rack Organizer Insert for Kitchen Cabinet - Multi Tier Adjustable Spice Storage Shelf for Seasoning and Jar, Pack of 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qW4WGE0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We pay attention to details and hope to bring customers a better shopping experience. We believe that quality is very important, so we use high-quality durable materials to design our spice rack organizer for drawer. Product specifications: Quantity: 12 PCS  Material: Made of sturdy ABS  Size: Each spice organizer for drawer is 4.7W x 8L x 1.1H inches; The 12-piece set can be expanded to 14.1W x 32L x 1.1H inches Khrodin advantages of drawer spice organizer Material features: ABS material is very light, easy to clean  Layering design：Create more space among cluttered cabinets, shelves and pantry to keep your kitchen looking clean and tidy Extensible design: With the characteristics of expansion and adjustment  No installation: Simply place it in a kitchen drawer and unfold to its best size Note: You'd better measure the drawer to make sure it is deep enough for the spice rack and spice bottle. Please do not put the drawer spice rack in the dishwasher . After sales: We always pay attention to customer experience and feedback on products. If you have any questions or are not satisfied with our products, please feel free to contact us and we will solve any problems you have immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qW4WGE0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Khordin","source_asin":"B09PV3WBDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PV3WBDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PV3WBDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":388772,"name":"Spotpack - Reusable Beeswax Food Wraps (Pack of 3) | All Natural and Biodegradable Eco Alternative to Food Freshness and Storage | Small, Medium and L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qh1WYQFwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convenient, Easy to Use & Sustainable Are you tired of wasting huge amounts of single use plastic bags and cling wrap? Did you know that the average American throws away about 185 pounds of plastic waste every year. Now, at least when it comes to your food storage plastic, you can help reduce that number and help protect the environment. Plus, reusing our beeswax wraps can save the average American family hundreds of dollars over the course of a year! Easy to Clean Each wrap can be handwashed with mild soap and then air dried. Eventually the beeswax and natural oils and resins will leave the cotton fabric, but you can always reapply wax to make them good as new. Or simply recycle or repurpose the beautiful cotton sheets into a cleaning dish, towel or rag. When properly washed and dried, each wrap can last over a year of regular use. Creates a Tight Cling Seal Fold and press the wraps around the edges of your food or produce. Or use them to cover ceramic, glass, metal or plastic containers or dishware. The wax naturally softens when exposed to the warmth of your hand and then hardens into a tight seal after a few minutes. This process is even faster if you put the food or container in the refrigerator or freezer. Fantastic Gift Anyone who loves sustainable products and wants to reduce their environmental impact will love these fun and convenient beeswax food wraps. Each wrap is handmade in Australia from premium material and natural ingredients. We also offer variety packs with a random assortment of our popular prints! Dimensions Small – 8 inches by 7 inches Medium – 10 inches by 9 inches Large – 14 inches by 13 inches Join thousands of happy customers… Click Add-to-Cart to order your set of 3 organic beeswax reusable food wraps","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qh1WYQFwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spotpack","source_asin":"B07VCJ9PN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-388772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VCJ9PN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VCJ9PN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
